{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Light Here 是一款專為跨時區聯繫而設的通話時機工具，適合有親友或同事身處海外的用戶。它以時鐘顯示各地時間，讓用戶一眼判斷是否適合致電，原價 US $4.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-4.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>跨時區通話時機一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>Light Here 以時鐘呈現最多四個地點的當地時間，並以顏色標示通話時機：金色代表適合致電，珊瑚色代表清晨或深夜、宜先傳訊息，藍色則代表對方可能正在熟睡。用戶可滑動時間軸預覽各地時間，一鍵跳至所有人皆清醒的時段。App 完全離線運作，內建超過 159,000 個城鎮，不含廣告與追蹤。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-6-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-7-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-8-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-9-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-10-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Light Here</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/light-here/id6818939740\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:07.828595+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T21:40:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:17.232885+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:06.908393+00:00","content_hash":"f57eb0e3922960bef8bf22350a6e5efe8f39c06bc66cb29ad20bc024b747aeca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}